<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-02-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on the</p>
<p>opening day of four-day Supersport series cricket matches on</p>
<p>Saturday:</p>
<p>In Durban: Griqualand West 91 (Tertius Bosch 5-15). Natal</p>
<p>21-0.</p>
<p>In Bloemfontein: Free State 324-8 (Kosie Venter 101, Deon</p>
<p>Jordaan 68) v Border.</p>
